msgid " to unlock traits, perks, and more on the title screen!"
msgstr "로 타이틀 화면에서 특성, 특전 등을 해금하세요!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Every day is a great teacher, as long as you don't get eaten."
msgstr "매일매일이 훌륭한 스승이다. 잡아먹히지만 않으면."

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Time heals all wounds, especially zombie bites."
msgstr "시간은 모든 상처를 치유한다. 특히 좀비한테 물린 상처를."

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Even in the post apocalypse, it's still possible to get swole."
msgstr "종말 이후에도 근육은 키울 수 있다."

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Running from zombies all day is a great form of exercise."
msgstr "하루 종일 좀비한테서 도망치는 건 훌륭한 운동이다."

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Getting used to these zombies makes for steadier aiming."
msgstr "좀비에 익숙해지니 조준이 안정된다."

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "All these cars aren't getting any less broken."
msgstr "차들은 하나같이 고장 난 채 그대로다."

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "When it comes to zombie first aid, practice makes perfect."
msgstr "좀비 응급처치도 연습하면 완벽해진다."

