msgid " feels a huge surge in strength!"
msgstr "은(는) 엄청난 힘이 솟구치는 걸 느낀다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " is getting used to all this exercise!"
msgstr "은(는) 이 모든 운동에 익숙해지고 있다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " feels like a gunslinger!"
msgstr "은(는) 총잡이가 된 기분이다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " is becoming a zombie master!"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 달인이 되어 가고 있다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid ""
" is getting toughened up!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 단단해지고 있다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " gains an extra point of maximum health!"
msgstr "의 최대 체력이 1 늘어난다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid ""
" gets really good at running!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 달리기 실력이 엄청 늘었다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " now permanently runs faster!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 영구적으로 더 빨리 달린다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " gets in tune with the car spirits!"
msgstr "은(는) 자동차 정령과 교감한다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid " invents a breakthrough in zombie health care!"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 의학에 획기적인 발견을 한다!"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid ""
" feels completely revitalized!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 완전히 기운을 되찾았다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "'s health is full!"
msgstr "의 체력이 가득 찼다!"

