#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid ""
" got further on the Death Road than he ever did before!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 그 어느 때보다 데스 로드를 멀리 왔다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Here's a code to celebrate: "
msgstr "축하 기념 코드: "

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid "Glimmer of Hope on the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드의 희망의 빛"

#: deathforth/dailydecks.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/dailydecks.df"
msgid ""
" feels inspired after managing to survive that situation!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 위기를 헤쳐 나온 뒤 영감을 얻는다!\r\n"
"\t"

