#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " speeds on. "
msgstr "은(는) 그대로 달린다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " really wanted to believe, but tells "
msgstr "은(는) 정말 믿고 싶었지만, "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "self to "
msgstr "에게 스스로 말한다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:13
#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "COOL IT"
msgstr "진정해"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " rubs it in by saying "
msgstr "은(는) 약 올리듯 말한다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " a second time."
msgstr " 한 번 더."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " turns the car around to investigate. "
msgstr "은(는) 확인하러 차를 돌린다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid ""
" finds only a single large footprint where the sasquatch was alledged to be. \r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 새스콰치가 있었다던 자리에서 커다란 발자국 하나만 발견한다. \r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " snaps an "
msgstr "은(는) 찍는다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "instant photo"
msgstr "즉석 사진"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " wants to believe."
msgstr "는 믿고 싶다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " applauds "
msgstr "은(는) 박수를 보낸다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "'s victory. "
msgstr "의 승리에. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " leaps from the car and locks arms with the sasquatch. "
msgstr "은(는) 차에서 뛰어내려 새스콰치와 팔씨름 자세로 맞붙는다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "The sasquatch is no match for "
msgstr "새스콰치는 상대가 안 된다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid ", and submits easily."
msgstr ". 새스콰치가 순순히 항복한다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "After what seems like hours of "
msgstr "몇 시간 같은 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "the wrastle"
msgstr "레슬링"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid ", the sasquatch finally submits."
msgstr " 끝에, 새스콰치가 마침내 항복한다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " is put immediately into an arm bar. This sasquatch knows Judo. "
msgstr "는 곧바로 암바에 걸린다. 이 새스콰치는 유도를 안다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " is forced to submit to the greater opponent."
msgstr "은(는) 더 강한 상대에게 항복할 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "And Then a Sasquatch"
msgstr "그리고 새스콰치가 나타났다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid ""
" sees a sasquatch on the side of the road, minding its own damn business."
msgstr "은(는) 길가에서 새스콰치를 본다. 제 할 일 하며 얌전히 있다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "Bigfoot ain't real"
msgstr "빅풋은 가짜야"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid "Turn around and investigate"
msgstr "차를 돌려서 확인한다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/001-sasquatch.df"
msgid " tries to wrestle it"
msgstr "이(가) 씨름을 걸어 본다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " grabs the wheel and "
msgstr "은(는) 핸들을 잡고 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "pounds the gas pedal"
msgstr "액셀을 밟아 버린다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "The car bolts forward, ripping a "
msgstr "차가 튀어 나가며 하늘을 찢는 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "howling screech"
msgstr "끔찍한 굉음"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " into the sky."
msgstr "을(를) 낸다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " counts down from three and when "
msgstr "은(는) 셋부터 거꾸로 센다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " hits one "
msgstr "가 하나를 외치자 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " flings open the doors and leaps from the moving car!"
msgstr "이(가) 문을 열어젖히고 달리는 차에서 뛰어내린다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "Against all odds, "
msgstr "놀랍게도, "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid ""
" managed to jump into the open door of a second car! The keys are in the "
"ignition."
msgstr "은(는) 다른 차의 열린 문으로 뛰어드는 데 성공했다! 열쇠가 꽂혀 있다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "The new car is a sturdy but gas guzzling SUV!"
msgstr "새 차는 튼튼하지만 기름을 많이 먹는 SUV다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "It's a fast and easy to repair muscle car!"
msgstr "빠르고 수리하기 쉬운 머슬카다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "The new car is a fuel efficient hybrid!"
msgstr "새 차는 연비 좋은 하이브리드다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " kicks over and "
msgstr "은(는) 몸을 날려 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "slams on the brakes"
msgstr "급브레이크를 밟는다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid ""
" jams forward buckling all over the seats and dash like crumpled dolls."
msgstr "은(는) 구겨진 인형처럼 좌석과 대시보드에 처박힌다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "The car is fine but everything else hurts like hell."
msgstr "차는 멀쩡한데 나머지는 전부 죽을 만큼 아프다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid ""
"The car careens out of control, hurling in a misdirected semi-circle and "
"slams into a "
msgstr "차가 통제를 잃고 엉뚱하게 반원을 그리며 처박는다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "chunk of buckled road"
msgstr "휘어진 도로 덩어리"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid " seems alright, but the car is damaged."
msgstr "은(는) 괜찮아 보이지만, 차가 손상됐다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "Jump it, Man!"
msgstr "뛰어넘어!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "Suddenly, a "
msgstr "갑자기, "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "GIANT FISSURE"
msgstr "거대한 균열"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid ""
" erupts across the road ahead. \r\n"
"\tIt's big. Super big. The asphalt buckles on either side, making for a pretty sick ramp. "
msgstr ""
"이(가) 앞쪽 도로를 가로지르며 터져 나온다. \r\n"
"\t크다. 엄청 크다. 양쪽 아스팔트가 휘어져서 끝내주는 점프대가 되었다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "GUN IT"
msgstr "밟아"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "Bail"
msgstr "뛰어내리기"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/002-jumpit.df"
msgid "Slam on the brakes"
msgstr "급브레이크"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " is now "
msgstr "는 이제 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " puts the pedal to the metal and DRIVES ON THROUGH!"
msgstr "은(는) 액셀을 끝까지 밟고 그대로 통과한다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " emerges back on the road a moment later, like nothing happened. Yet "
msgstr "은(는) 잠시 후 아무 일 없었다는 듯 도로로 돌아온다. 그런데 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " feel"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " different..."
msgstr "뭔가 달라진 기분이다..."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:70
#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
"NOW YOU'VE DONE IT\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"너 이제 큰일 났다\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " re-emerges, feeling new and amazing!"
msgstr "은(는) 다시 나타난다. 새롭고 놀라운 기분이다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " re-emerges, changed."
msgstr "은(는) 다시 나타난다. 변해 버렸다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "Who should be OPTIMALLY tossed into the vortex?"
msgstr "누구를 최적의 방법으로 소용돌이에 던질까?"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "Who should be tossed into the vortex?"
msgstr "누구를 소용돌이에 던질까?"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "ACCORDING TO "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
"'s CALCULATIONS you could chuck someone in here and it would change them, "
"probably not even in a fatal way!"
msgstr "의 계산에 따르면 누군가를 여기 던져 넣으면 변하게 될 것이다. 아마 죽지는 않을 거다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
" crunches some extra numbers and figures out the optimal way to toss someone"
" in!"
msgstr "는 숫자를 좀 더 굴려서 최적의 투척 방법을 알아낸다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:102
#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "Don't mess with that portal"
msgstr "그 포탈은 건드리지 마"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
" tries to bite the portal and then slides right into it.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 포탈을 물려다 그대로 미끄러져 들어간다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " reappears moments later, with a strange new intelligence."
msgstr "는 잠시 후 이상한 새 지능을 얻어 다시 나타난다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
" takes a swing and then falls into the portal in the same smooth motion. \r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 주먹을 휘두르다 그 동작 그대로 포탈에 빠진다. \r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
" reappears moments later, now much more furry. At least, it's probably "
msgstr "는 잠시 후 훨씬 털북숭이가 되어 다시 나타난다. 아마도 "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " keeps "
msgstr "은(는) 유지한다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " human intelligence!"
msgstr " 인간의 지능!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "The Tetrographic Vortex"
msgstr "테트로그래픽 소용돌이"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid " notices a "
msgstr "은(는) 발견한다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "geometrically impossible vortex"
msgstr "기하학적으로 불가능한 소용돌이"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ""
" forming in front of the moving car. \r\n"
"\tIt hovers a few feet in front of the bumper at speed, humming ominously."
msgstr ""
"이(가) 달리는 차 앞에 생겨난다. \r\n"
"\t범퍼 몇 걸음 앞에서 같은 속도로 떠다니며 불길하게 웅웅거린다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "Drive through it"
msgstr "그대로 통과한다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:146
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ": CALCULATE its VECTORS"
msgstr ": 벡터를 계산한다"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid "Don't mess with it!"
msgstr "건드리지 마!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/003-vortex.df"
msgid ": Fight it!"
msgstr ": 싸운다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " kicks "
msgstr "은(는) 걷어찬다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ""
" out through the passenger door. \r\n"
"\tAs "
msgstr ""
"을(를) 조수석 문밖으로. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " falls, "
msgstr "이(가) 떨어지는 순간, "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " explodes into a swarm of tiny black bats."
msgstr "은(는) 작은 검은 박쥐 떼로 터져 버린다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ""
"UGH, WELL, THANKS ANYWAY I GUESS.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"으, 뭐, 그래도 고맙다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "The demon releases "
msgstr "악마가 풀어 준다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ", who is changed by the experience."
msgstr ". 그 경험으로 사람이 변했다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ""
"THANKS FOR THE SOOOUUUUUUUUL.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"영혼 고마워어어어어어.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "All the survivors are infused with demonic power."
msgstr "생존자 모두에게 악마의 힘이 깃든다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "Who should be sacrificed to HEKATRIUS?"
msgstr "누구를 헤카트리우스에게 제물로 바칠까?"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ""
"THANKS A BUNCH, DINGUS.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"고맙다, 멍청아.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "The demon blasts "
msgstr "악마가 공격한다: "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " with spooky powers, then vanishes!"
msgstr ". 으스스한 힘을 쏘고는 사라진다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "The chips were pizza flavored. GOOD ENOUGH."
msgstr "감자칩이 피자 맛이었다. 그거면 됐다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " HEKATRIUS"
msgstr " 헤카트리우스"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ""
" asks for a soul to wash it down with.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 입가심할 영혼을 요구한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "WHO WILL BE SACRIFICED?"
msgstr "누가 제물이 될 것인가?"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "Uh, sacrifice no one."
msgstr "어, 아무도 안 바칠래."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid ""
"CURSE YOU HUMAN! CURSE YOU!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"저주한다 인간! 저주한다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:85
#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:98
#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "HEKATRIUS"
msgstr "헤카트리우스"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " vanishes. "
msgstr "은(는) 사라진다. "

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " feels pretty good about this."
msgstr "은(는) 꽤 뿌듯하다."

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid "What a miracle punch!"
msgstr "기적의 펀치다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " freaks out!"
msgstr "은(는) 기겁한다!"

#: deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/don/events/common/004-demon.df"
msgid " freaks out for awhile! He then morphs back into "
msgstr "은(는) 한참 발광한다! 그러고는 다시 돌아온다: "

