msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid " is ready for a road trip!"
msgstr "은(는) 로드 트립 준비 완료!"

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid "You've recruited enough jerks! The car is full!"
msgstr "얼간이를 충분히 모았다! 차가 꽉 찼다!"

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid ""
" claims to know you, but you swear you've never seen this person before..."
msgstr "는 너를 안다고 주장하지만, 넌 이 사람을 본 적이 없다고 맹세할 수 있다..."

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid "TRAIT: "
msgstr "특성: "

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid "  PERK: "
msgstr "  특전: "

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid "You can recruit "
msgstr "앞으로 "

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid " more jerks!"
msgstr "명 더 영입할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid " for now"
msgstr "은(는) 일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/4jerksmode.df"
msgid "Recruit "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " decides to play it safe. "
msgstr "은(는) 안전하게 가기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " give"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " into the bandits' demands."
msgstr "약탈자들의 요구에 굴복한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " knows that every single one of "
msgstr "은(는) 알고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " supplies are essential for "
msgstr " 물자 하나하나가 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " chances of reaching Canada. So "
msgstr " 캐나다행에 꼭 필요하다는 걸. 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " fight"
msgstr "은(는) 싸운다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " food "
msgstr " 식량을 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "to pass safely."
msgstr "내야 안전하게 지나갈 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Pay toll of "
msgstr "통행료 지불: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:49
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " food"
msgstr " 식량"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"the remainder of your food, and a quarter of your ammo and medical supplies."
msgstr "남은 식량 전부, 그리고 탄약과 의약품의 4분의 1."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"the remainder of your food, and half of your ammo and medical supplies."
msgstr "남은 식량 전부, 그리고 탄약과 의약품의 절반."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Give in to bandit demands"
msgstr "약탈자의 요구에 응한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "all your extra gas, and half of your ammo and medical supplies!"
msgstr "남는 기름 전부, 그리고 탄약과 의약품의 절반!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "all of your ammo, medical supplies, and extra gas tanks!"
msgstr "탄약, 의약품, 여분의 기름통 전부!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Give in to harsh bandit demands"
msgstr "약탈자의 가혹한 요구에 응한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Refuse and fight!"
msgstr "거부하고 싸운다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tricks the bandits. While they wait for supplies to be dropped, "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들을 속인다. 놈들이 물자를 내려놓길 기다리는 사이, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" runs into the car and peels out.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits manage to shoot the car as it's speeding away! They only have time to graze it."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차로 달려가 급출발한다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들이 달아나는 차에 총을 쏜다! 스치기만 할 시간밖에 없었다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The car gets an extra hole or two added to it, and is otherwise fine."
msgstr "차에 구멍이 한두 개 더 났지만, 나머지는 괜찮다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ", not willing or able to spare other supplies, decides to dump out "
msgstr "은(는) 다른 물자를 내줄 수도, 내주고 싶지도 않아서, 트렁크에서 버리기로 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" extra weapons from the trunk.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 여분의 무기를.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "EXTRA WEAPONS LOST!"
msgstr "여분의 무기 분실!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
", not willing or able to spare other supplies, decides to lose some treasured personal items to the bandits.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 다른 물자를 내줄 수도, 내주고 싶지도 않아서, 아끼는 개인 물품을 약탈자들에게 넘기기로 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "WHAT A BUMMER!"
msgstr "정말 우울하다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " offers a compromise to the bandits. "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 타협안을 제시한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" will leave something the bandits want on the road, then drive away. No harm"
" will come to either side."
msgstr "은(는) 놈들이 원하는 걸 길에 놓고 그냥 떠나겠다고 한다. 양쪽 다 다칠 일 없다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The supplies will be:"
msgstr "내놓을 물자:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "SEE YA, NERDS!!"
msgstr "잘 있어라, 찐따들아!!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Half your ammo"
msgstr "탄약 절반"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Your extra gas tanks"
msgstr "여분의 기름통"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Half your medical supplies"
msgstr "의약품 절반"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Personal treasures"
msgstr "개인 보물"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "All trunk weapons"
msgstr "트렁크 무기 전부"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:118
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " offers a compromise"
msgstr "이(가) 타협을 제시한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " farts on the toll bridge."
msgstr "은(는) 통행료 다리 위에 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tells the bridge bandits to"
msgstr "은(는) 다리 약탈자들에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:128
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:218
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:282
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " COOL IT."
msgstr " 진정해."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"This really makes the bandits think. \r\n"
"\t\tHave they just been too greedy?\r\n"
"\t\tThey offer a gift in order to start making amends!"
msgstr ""
"그 말에 약탈자들이 진지하게 생각에 잠긴다. \r\n"
"\t\t그동안 너무 욕심을 부렸던 걸까?\r\n"
"\t\t그들은 사과의 뜻으로 선물을 건넨다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The bandits refuse to lower the bridge until they get most of "
msgstr "약탈자들은 물자 대부분을 받을 때까지 다리를 내리지 않겠다고 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "'s supplies."
msgstr "의 물자 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " draws "
msgstr "은(는) 뽑아 든다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " weapon"
msgstr " 무기"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " on the bandits."
msgstr "을(를) 약탈자들에게 겨눈다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" so fast that the bandits are overwhelmed, and forced to lower the bridge.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 너무 빨라서 약탈자들은 압도당하고, 다리를 내릴 수밖에 없다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " passes through the bridge unharmed."
msgstr "은(는) 무사히 다리를 건넌다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" is real mad about having to pay bridge tolls, even post-civilization. "
msgstr "은(는) 문명이 망한 뒤에도 다리 통행료를 내야 한다는 게 몹시 화가 난다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " runs right into the retracted bridge, sending the car flying past."
msgstr "는 접힌 다리로 그대로 돌진해 차를 날려 건넌다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"Bandits are guarding a retracted bridge over a river. They demand that anyone passing pays a toll.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"약탈자들이 강 위의 접힌 다리를 지키고 있다. 지나가는 사람은 통행료를 내라고 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "They want "
msgstr "요구하는 것: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Brandish guns"
msgstr "총을 휘두른다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:160
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:249
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tells Bandits to 'Cool It'"
msgstr "이(가) 약탈자들에게 '진정해'라고 말한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ": Take a detour instead"
msgstr ": 대신 우회한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ": LET'S JUMP IT"
msgstr ": 뛰어넘자"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" calls the bandits on their bluff, immediately. Before the bandits can yell,"
" "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들의 허세를 바로 간파한다. 약탈자들이 소리치기도 전에, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" is already making tons of noise.\r\n"
"\tAs the bandits panic and the zombies rush in, "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 이미 엄청난 소음을 내고 있다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들이 당황하고 좀비들이 몰려드는 사이, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" saunters away by a side route. It pays to constantly plan for the worst!"
msgstr "은(는) 옆길로 유유히 빠져나간다. 늘 최악을 대비하는 게 남는 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "With no warning and not a single word, "
msgstr "아무 경고도, 한마디 말도 없이, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" runs up to the nearest bandit and punches him in the face, knocking him "
"out. Then "
msgstr "은(는) 가장 가까운 약탈자에게 달려가 얼굴에 주먹을 꽂아 기절시킨다. 그러고는 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" does the same thing to a second bandit before calming down. \r\n"
"\tEveryone's stunned. The remaining three bandits decide they should quietly pick up their friends and leave."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 두 번째 약탈자에게도 똑같이 한 뒤에야 진정한다. \r\n"
"\t모두 얼어붙었다. 남은 약탈자 셋은 조용히 동료들을 챙겨 떠나기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " pays the bandits their extortion fee, instead of risking the carnage."
msgstr "은(는) 아수라장을 감수하느니 약탈자들에게 갈취 비용을 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"One of the bandits yells, and chaos erupts as the zombies swarm out. Escape "
"was messy."
msgstr "약탈자 하나가 소리치자 좀비들이 쏟아져 나오며 아수라장이 된다. 탈출은 엉망이었다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits were all talk, and don't make a sound when their bluff is "
"called. "
msgstr "약탈자들은 말뿐이었고, 허세가 들통나자 찍소리도 못 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " goes back to the car as the bandits creep away."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들이 슬금슬금 물러나는 사이 차로 돌아간다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " explains that "
msgstr "은(는) 설명한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " doesn't have enough food."
msgstr "에게 식량이 충분하지 않다고."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits don't seem to want to want to risk the carnage, so they accept "
"taking less food."
msgstr "약탈자들은 아수라장을 감수하고 싶지 않은지 식량을 덜 받기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The bandits think that this is a lie!"
msgstr "약탈자들은 거짓말이라고 생각한다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " calls the bandit's bluff."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자의 허세를 간파한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " farts really faintly at the bandits."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 아주 희미하게 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " Silent... but deadly."
msgstr " 소리 없이... 그러나 치명적으로."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "In a faint whisper, "
msgstr "아주 작은 속삭임으로, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:218
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tells the bandits to"
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits freeze in place, with no idea what to do. One offers a bribe if "
msgstr "약탈자들은 어찌할 바를 모르고 얼어붙는다. 한 명이 뇌물을 제안한다. 조건은 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" will just go away and never return.\r\n"
"\t\tThe bandits can give their supplies, or silently teach zombie secrets through sign language."
msgstr ""
"이(가) 그냥 떠나서 다시는 돌아오지 않는 것.\r\n"
"\t\t약탈자들은 물자를 주거나, 수화로 좀비의 비밀을 조용히 가르쳐 줄 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The bandits are, for what feels like a long time, taken aback by this."
msgstr "약탈자들은 한참 동안이나 어리둥절해한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Five bandits ambush "
msgstr "약탈자 다섯 명이 매복한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " while "
msgstr "이(가) "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" about to sneak into a zombie infested house.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits speak in a half-whisper, afraid to attract undead attention. They say to hand them over some supplies, or they'll yell."
msgstr ""
"좀비가 우글거리는 집에 몰래 들어가려던 참이다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들은 언데드의 관심을 끌까 봐 반쯤 속삭이며 말한다. 물자를 내놓지 않으면 소리치겠다고."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Give 10 food"
msgstr "식량 10 주기"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Don't have the food!"
msgstr "식량이 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " goes on a rampage"
msgstr "이(가) 난동을 부린다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " already had a plan"
msgstr "은(는) 이미 계획이 있었다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Call bluff"
msgstr "허세를 간파한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " challenges the bandits to a pose-off."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 포즈 대결을 신청한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" does an incredible flexing routine, honed by training. The bandits clearly "
"lose, and have to let "
msgstr "는 훈련으로 다듬은 놀라운 근육 자랑 루틴을 선보인다. 약탈자들은 명백히 졌고, 보디빌더의 규칙에 따라 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " go due to the Bodybuilder's Code."
msgstr "을(를) 보내 줄 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " is nowhere near the muscle mass of the bandits. "
msgstr "는 약탈자들의 근육량에 한참 못 미친다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" loses the pose-off almost instantly. The bandits take a lot of extra "
"supplies, even ones they don't need, to teach "
msgstr "는 포즈 대결에서 거의 즉시 패배한다. 약탈자들은 필요도 없는 물자까지 잔뜩 가져가며 교훈을 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " a lesson about the weak challenging the swole. "
msgstr "에게. 약자가 근육에게 도전하면 어떻게 되는지에 대해. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "By some strange twist of fate, "
msgstr "기묘한 운명의 장난으로, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" somehow wins the pose-off due to a little known loophole in the "
"bodybuilding judge's rulebook. The bandits are pretty angry about this, but "
"their hands are tied by their rules."
msgstr ""
"가 보디빌딩 심사 규정의 잘 알려지지 않은 허점 덕분에 포즈 대결에서 이긴다. 약탈자들은 몹시 화가 났지만, 규칙에 손이 묶여 있다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" manages to somehow beat the bandits in a bodybuilding competition, both in "
"the flexing segments and the talent segment! "
msgstr "는 어찌어찌 보디빌딩 대결에서 근육 부문과 장기자랑 부문 모두 약탈자들을 이긴다! "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " is let go."
msgstr "은(는) 풀려난다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" loses the pose-off. It's humiliating, and the bandits take a lot of "
"supplies as punishment for the hubris of challenging them."
msgstr "은(는) 포즈 대결에서 진다. 굴욕적이다. 약탈자들은 감히 도전한 오만함에 대한 벌로 물자를 잔뜩 가져간다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " farts at the bandits, and also the concept of bodybuilding."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게, 그리고 보디빌딩이라는 개념 자체에 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tells the buff bandits to"
msgstr "은(는) 근육 약탈자들에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"They are impressed by this bold attitude!\r\n"
"\t\tThey declare "
msgstr ""
"놈들은 이 대담한 태도에 감명받는다!\r\n"
"\t\t그들은 선언한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" their honorary champion!\r\n"
"\t\tThe bandits offer a gift:"
msgstr ""
"를 명예 챔피언으로!\r\n"
"\t\t약탈자들이 선물을 건넨다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits are enraged by this negative attitude, and take out their anger "
"on "
msgstr "약탈자들은 이 부정적인 태도에 분노해서 화풀이를 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "'s car. They all punch it bare-handed, doing some serious damage."
msgstr "의 차에. 모두가 맨주먹으로 차를 두들겨 심각한 피해를 입힌다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The buff bandits run off, flexing. Even the dog."
msgstr "근육 약탈자들이 근육 자랑을 하며 달려간다. 개까지."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " asks the buff bandits about their "
msgstr "은(는) 근육 약탈자들에게 묻는다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "SWEATBANDS"
msgstr "땀받이 밴드"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr "랑 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"CONSTANTLY LIFTING DUMBBELLS WHILE TALKING.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"말하면서 계속 덤벨 드는 거에 대해서.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The bandits talk about an amazing lost tradition of "
msgstr "약탈자들은 문명이 무너질 때 사라진 놀라운 전통, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "BODYBUILDING"
msgstr "보디빌딩"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" that was lost when civilization fell.\r\n"
"\tThey show what they mean in an inspiring muscle exhibition. In the process, the bandits forget about robbing "
msgstr ""
"에 대해 이야기한다.\r\n"
"\t그들은 감동적인 근육 시범으로 그게 뭔지 보여 준다. 그러는 동안 약탈자들은 털어 가는 것도 잊어버린다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "They're all wearing sweat bands"
msgstr "다들 땀받이 밴드를 차고 있다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:307
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"Bandits appear, all wearing sweatbands and all super buff, even their dog. They demand protein powder!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"약탈자들이 나타났다. 하나같이 땀받이 밴드를 차고 근육이 빵빵하다. 개까지. 프로틴 파우더를 내놓으란다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "They will also accept "
msgstr "대신 이것도 받는단다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " challenges them to a pose-off"
msgstr "이(가) 포즈 대결을 신청한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tells bandits to 'Cool It'"
msgstr "이(가) 약탈자들에게 '진정해'라고 말한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " asks what's up with outfits"
msgstr "이(가) 옷차림에 대해 묻는다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "half of the"
msgstr "절반의"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "all"
msgstr "전부의"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The bandits go through "
msgstr "약탈자들이 뒤진다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "'s things and take all the food and "
msgstr "의 소지품을. 그리고 식량 전부와 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" supplies.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 물자를 가져간다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:329
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" isn't happy about this, but at least the bandits didn't steal the car or "
"even siphon out the gas. In exchange for the cooperation, they also returned"
" any weapons."
msgstr "은(는) 기분이 좋지 않지만, 적어도 약탈자들이 차를 훔치거나 기름을 빼 가진 않았다. 협조해 준 대가로 무기는 돌려줬다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:345
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" decides to make a run for it, thinking that the hard won supplies are worth the risk.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits start shooting!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 어렵게 구한 물자를 지킬 가치가 있다고 판단하고 도망치기로 한다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들이 총을 쏘기 시작한다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " runs and runs, without getting tired! "
msgstr "은(는) 지치지도 않고 달리고 또 달린다! "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " only gets grazed."
msgstr "는 총알에 스치기만 한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " runs a few feet before getting winded. "
msgstr "은(는) 몇 걸음 못 가서 숨이 찬다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " gets hit hard."
msgstr "는 제대로 맞는다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " runs as far as "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " can! "
msgstr "가 갈 수 있는 데까지 달린다! "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " gets hit."
msgstr "는 총에 맞는다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " farts at the bandits, giving them all "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 방귀를 뀌어, 모두에게 선사한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " fart gas."
msgstr " 방귀 가스를."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"This stops the bandits in their tracks. \r\n"
"\t\tWhat if they've been living their lives wrong this whole time?\r\n"
"\t\tCould things have gone better if they simply 'cooled it'?\r\n"
"\t\tThey decide to only do good things from now on, and offer a gift!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"이 말에 약탈자들이 그 자리에 멈춘다. \r\n"
"\t\t지금까지 인생을 잘못 살아온 건 아닐까?\r\n"
"\t\t그냥 '진정'했다면 더 나았을까?\r\n"
"\t\t그들은 이제부터 좋은 일만 하기로 결심하고, 선물을 건넨다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " is unharmed, with "
msgstr "은(는) 다치지 않았고, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " spirits uplifted."
msgstr " 사기가 올라간다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "The bandits are not amused by this at all. They open fire as "
msgstr "약탈자들은 전혀 재밌어하지 않는다. 총을 쏘기 시작한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " tries to run away."
msgstr "이(가) 도망치려는 순간."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:379
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "On the plus side, most of the bullets hit "
msgstr "그나마 다행인 건, 총알 대부분이 맞은 사람이 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Always wary, "
msgstr "늘 경계하던 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " was on guard before the ambush. "
msgstr "은(는) 매복 전부터 경계하고 있었다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " dashes to a nearby but easy to overlook bit of cover. "
msgstr "는 근처의 눈에 잘 안 띄는 엄폐물로 재빨리 뛰어든다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " follows "
msgstr "은(는) 따라간다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits lose their overwhelming advantage, and run away after a brief "
"fight."
msgstr "약탈자들은 압도적인 우위를 잃고, 짧은 교전 끝에 도망친다."
